PRODUCT OVERVIEW

The Electronic Bible and Concordance, EBaC, has two main functions.
First, as a Bible, it displays a reference when you supply the book
name, chapter, and verse. Second, as a concordance, it displays the
list of verses in which the word you supply is found.
But, its really more powerful than that. Unlike a paper concordance,
you can easily view a verse in full context. Also, you can search by
common words such as, "I AM who I AM", which are not indexed in most
paper concordances.
